status GREEN -- the hot close reads 196 guards, 193 green, 0 red, 3 gated, 2,333s, tree_moved=no. two_rooms_doorway 43 over 43 with foundations at 0 silent of 83; two_rooms_doorway_touch 30 cases; seed_link front door 0 and ratchet 848; fold_shelf_link, fold_shelf_link_repoint, crushed_index, index_fold, index_row_bound, ascii_document, prose_register, qa_report_card, remember_git_nib and unshared_citation all green; every page touched grades B or better. The cold open closed guard_red with tree_moved=yes, by my own fault, and the first hot close caught the shelf-link red staging revealed; this is the second, clean one.
recommend keep-going -- context/ is the last unjoined room at 38 silent pages, the same shape again, and Air's reading says pay it with **Room:** lines so the register stands free of the lifecycle answer rather than braided into it
